      "source_sha256": "1a04f1da4283be291ec59c72b6ea8c759c2360b257fafff8269abd346aaa8710",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "北面招讨使石敬瑭奏自将兵屯百井以备契丹。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "12161386-f06f-52b7-82eb-86173979360b",
